<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n74225" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὄξος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εος</span>, τό<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">, ʽὀξύσ̓</span>”
				<i>poor wine, 'vin ordinaire',</i>
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ar.
					<u>Ach.</u>
					35
				</span></i>
			 ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κοτύλας τέτταρας ὄξους Δεκελικοῦ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Alex.
					285
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>An.</u>
				2.3.14
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>POxy.</u>
				1275.20
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(iii A. D.)</span> ; cf. 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὀξίνης</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					1
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>vinegar</i> made therefrom, <i><span class="en">
				<u>IG</u>
				12.334.4
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				A.
				<u>Ag.</u>
				322
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Acut.</u>
				61
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				11.413
			</span></i>, etc.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑπώμνυτο ὁ μὲν οἶνος ὄ. αὑτὸν
					εἶναι γνήσιον, τὸ δ᾽ ὄ. οἶνον αὑτό</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Eub.
					65
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σφόδρ᾽ ἐστὶν . . ὁ βίος οἴνῳ
					προσφερής: ὅταν ᾖ τὸ λοιπὸν μικρόν, ὄ. γίγνεται</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Antiph.
					240
				</span></i>
			 ; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐς τὰς ῥῖνας ὄ.
			ἐγχέων,</span> as a mode of torture, <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Ra.</u>
				620
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b> metaph., of a
				<i>sour fellow,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χὡνὴρ ὄ. ἅπαν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Theoc.
					15.148
				</span></i>
			.</div>
